---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';

const seoTitle = "BMW Key Replacement Nashville | Mobile & In-Shop Service";
const seoDescription = "Need a BMW key replaced in Nashville? Same-day BMW keys, Comfort Access smart fobs, CAS & FEM/BDC programming. Call (615) 625-8000.";
---

<Layout title={seoTitle} description={seoDescription} canonical="/bmw/">
  
  <header class="bg-[#0f274a] text-white py-14 sm:py-20 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 border-b-4 border-amber-500">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8 items-center">
      
      <div class="lg:col-span-7 flex flex-col gap-4 text-left">
        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-white/10 text-xs font-bold text-amber-300 w-fit">
          <span>TN Lic #406 &bull; Real Nashville Storefront + Mobile</span>
        </div>

        <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-black font-serif text-white tracking-tight leading-tight">
          BMW Key Replacement <br />
          <span class="text-amber-400">in Nashville, TN</span>
        </h1>

        <p class="text-base sm:text-lg text-slate-200 leading-relaxed font-normal">
          Need a BMW key replaced in Nashville? We can help. At Armstrong Locksmith Inc, we provide complete automotive locksmith services for BMWs—faster and more affordable than the dealership in many cases.
        </p>

        <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-stretch sm:items-center gap-3 pt-2">
          <a href="tel:6156258000" class="px-7 py-3.5 rounded-xl bg-emerald-600 hover:bg-emerald-500 text-white font-extrabold text-base flex items-center justify-center gap-2 shadow-lg transition">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-white" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M6.6 10.8c1.5 3 3.6 5.1 6.6 6.6l2.2-2.2c.3-.3.8-.4 1.2-.2 1 .4 2.1.6 3.2.6.7 0 1.2.5 1.2 1.2V20c0 .7-.5 1.2-1.2 1.2C10.9 21.2 2.8 13.1 2.8 3.2 2.8 2.5 3.3 2 4 2h3.2c.7 0 1.2.5 1.2 1.2 0 1.1.2 2.2.6 3.2.1.4 0 .9-.2 1.2L6.6 10.8Z"/></svg>
            <span>Call (615) 625-8000</span>
          </a>
          <a href="https://online-booking.workiz.com/?ac=ff72b9e4da07483dc3ea20c43712756d0e1998076465f7ea6768e02921635648" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="px-7 py-3.5 rounded-xl bg-amber-500 hover:bg-amber-400 text-slate-950 font-extrabold text-base flex items-center justify-center shadow-md transition">
            <span>Book Online</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="lg:col-span-5">
        <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-7 shadow-xl border border-slate-200 text-slate-900">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-[#0f274a] font-serif pb-3 border-b border-slate-100">
            BMW Service Highlights
          </h2>
          <ul class="flex flex-col gap-2.5 my-4 text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-700">
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <span class="text-emerald-600 font-bold">✓</span>
              <span><strong>Same-Day BMW Keys:</strong> Mobile service within a ~20-mile radius when possible.</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <span class="text-emerald-600 font-bold">✓</span>
              <span><strong>Comfort Access Fobs:</strong> Push-to-start smart proximity keys programmed.</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <span class="text-emerald-600 font-bold">✓</span>
              <span><strong>Spare Keys & Lost Keys:</strong> CAS1-CAS4 and FEM/BDC immobilizer support.</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <span class="text-emerald-600 font-bold">✓</span>
              <span><strong>Storefront Drop-In:</strong> Visit us directly at 208 Thompson Ln.</span>
            </li>
          </ul>
          <div class="pt-3 border-t border-slate-100 text-xs text-slate-500 font-medium">
            Some BMW models may require an OEM-ordered key depending on year/security. We will always tell you what is realistic before we start.
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </header>

  <!-- Complete Original WordPress Long-Form Content -->
  <section class="py-16 sm:py-20 bg-white px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 border-b border-slate-200">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto flex flex-col gap-10 text-slate-800 leading-relaxed text-sm sm:text-base">
      
      <div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-[#0f274a] font-serif mb-4">
          Why Replace Your BMW Key with Armstrong?
        </h2>
        <p class="mb-3">
          BMW keys require specialized programming and proprietary diagnostics. While the dealership often demands that you tow your car to their service bay, pay diagnostic fees, and wait days or weeks for a key to be shipped from Germany, Armstrong Locksmith provides a faster, local alternative.
        </p>
        <p>
          We carry advanced dealer-grade bench programmers and OBD diagnostic tools that allow us to calculate ISN numbers, pre-code blank transponders, and sync new smart keys to your BMW's CAS or FEM/BDC module right here in Nashville.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
        <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-[#0f274a] font-serif mb-2">E-Series (CAS1, CAS2, CAS3/CAS3+)</h3>
          <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600 mb-3">
            Covering 3-Series (E90/E91/E92/E93), 5-Series (E60/E61), X5 (E70), X6 (E71), and Z4. We cut the physical emergency blade and program diamond keys or comfort access push-start fobs.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-[#0f274a] font-serif mb-2">F-Series (FEM / BDC & CAS4/CAS4+)</h3>
          <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600 mb-3">
            Covering modern 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7 Series, X1, X3, X4, X5, and X6. We handle both spare key additions and complex all-keys-lost programming directly on the vehicle.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-2xl bg-amber-50/60 border border-amber-200">
        <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-[#0f274a] font-serif mb-3">
          Real Local Storefront — No Call Centers
        </h2>
        <p class="mb-3">
          Armstrong Locksmith is run by owner Rahim with 20+ years of security experience. When you call (615) 625-8000, you speak with our actual Nashville team at 208 Thompson Ln—not an out-of-state call center.
        </p>
        <p>
          We provide upfront quotes before starting any work. If your BMW is drivable and you want to save on mobile dispatch fees, feel free to stop by our shop during business hours!
        </p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Final Call CTA Banner -->
  <section class="bg-[#0f274a] text-white py-14 px-4 sm:px-6 text-center">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto flex flex-col items-center gap-4">
      <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-4xl font-bold font-serif text-white">Need a BMW Key in Nashville?</h2>
      <p class="text-slate-200 text-sm sm:text-base">Call now to confirm same-day availability for your exact BMW year and model.</p>
      <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center gap-3 pt-2">
        <a href="tel:6156258000" class="px-8 py-3.5 rounded-xl bg-emerald-600 hover:bg-emerald-500 text-white font-extrabold text-base shadow">
          Call (615) 625-8000
        </a>
        <a href="https://online-booking.workiz.com/?ac=ff72b9e4da07483dc3ea20c43712756d0e1998076465f7ea6768e02921635648" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="px-8 py-3.5 rounded-xl bg-amber-500 hover:bg-amber-400 text-slate-950 font-extrabold text-base shadow">
          Book Online
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
